# omarchy-base.packages — phase-1 additive session stack
# Derived from omacom/omarchy @ quattro (4.0.x), clone commit 3faafba234e530b0986196b98dc2c38951e7dd6f
# Plan: ~/Projects/etc/omarchy-integration-plan.md phase 1 (session-only, no boot-chain contact).
# Note: omarchy v4 ships no hypridle/hyprlock/hyprpaper — lock screen is owe/owe-lockfeed.

# Hyprland session core
hyprland
uwsm
quickshell
foot
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
hyprland-guiutils
hyprland-preview-share-picker # aur
hyprpicker
hyprsunset

# Session utilities (from omarchy-base.packages, session-booting subset)
grim
slurp
cliphist
wl-clipboard
wtype
brightnessctl
pamixer
wireplumber
xdg-terminal-exec

# Lock-screen / desktop-video (v4 uses OWE instead of hyprlock/hypridle)
owe # aur
owe-lockfeed # aur

# EXCLUDED (avoid-list, conflict matrix — do NOT install):
# linux-omarchy            — cachyos 7.2.8-1 kernel stays; DO NOT install (also -headers)
# limine-entry-tool        — Limine 12.9 + snapper-sync already working; dropins DO NOT install
# mkinitcpio hooks / UKI   — existing hook chain stays
# sddm                     — already present; theme dropins skipped (keep cachyos-themes-sddm)
# plymouth                 — cachyos bootanimation stays
# (sudoers.d/tmpfiles.d, nsswitch.conf, faillock.conf — file writes, not packages; plan says SKIP)
